{"id":"660419","name":"玫瑰酱红糖鲜花饼","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660419/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玫瑰酱","amount":"4勺"},{"name":"干玫瑰花","amount":"5朵"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"2碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红糖","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面团醒好擀成圆饼。","img":"images/660419/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"玫瑰花酱与红糖、干玫瑰花泡开攥去水分，玉米油混合拌匀，加少许面粉和匀。","img":"images/660419/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"这样划二刀。","img":"images/660419/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"抹上玫瑰花酱，右边这片留着不抹。","img":"images/660419/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"左右角折过来。","img":"images/660419/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"往上掀起叠放。","img":"images/660419/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"两侧合上。","img":"images/660419/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"向上掀起叠放。","img":"images/660419/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"两侧合上捏好边缘。","img":"images/660419/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"擀好放入电端铛中。","img":"images/660419/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"烙至两面金黄。","img":"images/660419/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切块。","img":"images/660419/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660419/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"香香甜甜。","img":"images/660419/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"同法做了千层肉饼也。","img":"images/660419/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"两种饼。","img":"images/660419/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}